    "hideComponent": "false",
    "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
    "text": "<h3><span class=\"futura-bold\">Key benefits</span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Available in diameters from 7mm to 17mm—increasing by 1mm increments. Unlike stems with 2mm increments, Tornier Perform Humeral System–Fracture gives you a 130mm stem with 11 unique measurements.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>Featuring three fixation methods: cemented, cementless without screws, and cementless with three screws. We’re giving you the power to decide.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>Tornier Perform Humeral System–Fracture keeps your suture options open.</li>\n</ul>\n",
    "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Sep 20 2024 23:06:05 GMT+0000",
